# GraphQL API

## Schema

```graphql
type Query {
  pages: [Page!]!
  page(slug: String!): Page
  files(path: String): [FileEntry!]!
  fileContent(path: String!): String
}

type Page {
  slug: String!
  title: String!
  tags: [String!]!
  content: String!
}
```

## Usage

```graphql
query {
  pages {
    title
    tags
  }
}
```
